      482.23,
      533.74,
      562.54
    ],
    "text": "The atmospheric conditions are getting favorable for afternoon thundershowers in most parts of the island from 1st of October. The general public is kindly requested to take adequate precautions to minimize damage caused by temporary localized strong winds and lightning during thundershowers.",
    "fonts": [
